isting.  F"},{"s":43.8,"e":44.4,"who":"user","text":"Okay."},{"s":46.2,"e":53.6,"who":"agent","text":"Alright, let\u2019s sort out what you\u2019re allowed to do here. Being on speaker doesn\u2019t change authority. If you\u2019re not the account holder, I need to confirm you\u2019re either a recorded delegate or an accepted co-host before"},{"s":57.8,"e":58.2,"who":"user","text":"Okay, what do you need from me?"},{"s":61.6,"e":62.0,"who":"agent","text":"To get started, I need the account holder\u2019s identifier. Do you have the email address or the phone number"},{"s":67.8,"e":68.4,"who":"user","text":"His email is walter dot mitchell at brightmail dot com."},{"s":76.8,"e":83.8,"who":"agent","text":"Okay, let me make sure I heard that email correctly before we go any further. I heard the email as walter.mitchell@brightm"},{"s":83.8,"e":84.4,"who":"user","text":"It\u2019s walter dot mitchell at brightmail dot com."},{"s":91.2,"e":96.8,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks. I have the email as walter.mitchell@brightmail.com. Is that exactly correc"},{"s":97.8,"e":98.6,"who":"user","text":"Yes, that\u2019s exact."},{"s":104.4,"e":105.4,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks. I have the email as walter.mitchell@brightmail."},{"s":104.4,"e":105.4,"who":"user","text":"Hello? Are you"},{"s":107.8,"e":108.4,"who":"user","text":"Yes, that\u2019s right."},{"s":112.6,"e":121.8,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks. I found an account that matches that email, but since you\u2019re not the account holder, I can\u2019t make any changes or access sensitive details on their behalf just from"},{"s":121.8,"e":122.4,"who":"user","text":"Okay. Is my dad able to authorize me on speakerphone?"},{"s":131.4,"e":134.2,"who":"user","text":"Hello? Can my dad authorize me on speakerphone?"},{"s":137.4,"e":137.8,"who":"agent","text":"Short answer: no, not just by saying it on speakerphone.  For Hearthway, authority has to come from the account holder through the proper channel. If your dad wants to add you as a delegate